            ],
            "key": "5b05n",
            "text": "工具定位：字节跳动官方发布的独立办公 Agent 工作台，主打 Computer Use 电脑操作、飞书组织上下文继承、云电脑长效托管与多智能体协作。\n官方入口：https://www.doubao.com/work（新用户下载安装可免费领取 30 天订阅权益）。",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 0,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "des3f",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 19,
                "offset": 28,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "1e1ta",
            "text": "字节跳动正式推出了面向职场与一人公司的全新生产力形态——「豆包工作」（Doubao Work）。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5pmsd",
            "text": "很多人以为这又是另一个套壳的对话大模型，但实际体验下来，它的定位发生了本质变化：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 63,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "fl7cf",
            "text": "它不再是一个陪你聊天的对话框，而是一个真正具备 Computer Use 能力、能直接操控电脑、读懂组织上下文的“数字员工”。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 28,
                "offset": 49,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "24a7q",
            "text": "如果你平时用过 Codex 或 Claude 的自动化工作流，你会发现「豆包工作」最大的优势在于：它原生打通了国内的办公生态（尤其是飞书与各类企业连接器），彻底解决了通用大模型“无法触达本地文件、不知道企业内部上下文、只能给建议无法动手执行”的痛点。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3s9kj",
            "text": "下面是一份完整的从零上手到实战落地指南，文内整理了 5 套可以直接复制套用的真实工作流 Prompt。\n",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 1,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9j634",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "21e7n",
            "text": "01 / 先搞清本质：它到底是什么、和传统 AI 有何不同？",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 13,
                "offset": 8,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "p85u",
            "text": "豆包工作的核心是「工作任务（Agent）」模式：你只需要用自然语言描述最终目标，它会自动拆解步骤、调用工具、打开应用、持续推进，直到交付可用结果。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 2,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "720bh",
            "text": "🌟 核心能力清单：",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 3,
                "length": 2,
                "offset": 3
              },
              {
                "key": 4,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 114
              },
              {
                "key": 5,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 186
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 27,
                "offset": 3,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 11,
                "offset": 114,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 24,
                "offset": 186,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "f8l58",
            "text": "1. 🖥️ 本地与云端 Computer Use（操作电脑）：\n   - 像真人一样模拟视觉识别、鼠标移动、点击、键盘输入；\n   - 能够自主打开浏览器搜索、读取本地指定文件夹、清洗数据并自动填入 Excel 表格。\n\n2. 📱 手机远程跨设备派单：\n   - 人在通勤或出差途中，用手机豆包 App 发送指令，工位电脑在后台自动跑任务，到办公室直接收割成果。\n\n3. 🔌 200+ 专属技能（Skill）与高频连接器：\n   - 原生打通飞书、企业微信、天眼查、同花顺、高德地图、滴滴企业版等；\n   - 支持一键调取财报数据、工商信息、发票报销与路线规划。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 6,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 3
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 34,
                "offset": 3,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "5b4tu",
            "text": "4. 👥 工作伙伴小队（Multi-Agent Swarm 多智能体协同）：\n   - 可在同一个任务中组建由“行业调研员、文案主笔、数据分析师、视觉设计师”组成的 AI 战队分工协同。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 7,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 3
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 16,
                "offset": 3,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 86,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "2c9eh",
            "text": "5. 🎨 多模态一站式生成与精细化局改：\n   - 集成 Seedream（高质量图像生成）与 Seedance（动态视频生成）；\n   - 生成的文档、PPT 和表格支持“指哪改哪”，直接框选局部段落精修，无需重写全文。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 8,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 3
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 20,
                "offset": 3,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "95qjl",
            "text": "6. 🏢 深度继承飞书组织上下文（核心护城河）：\n   - 登录飞书账号后，AI 直接继承权限体系，能够安全读取聊天记录、妙记会议纪要、知识库与项目看板。\n",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 9,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9iihh",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ejjlq",
            "text": "02 / 5 分钟极简上手与安全配置指南",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "aq6pd",
            "text": "步骤 1：下载正版客户端",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "urls": [
                {
                  "fromIndex": 7,
                  "text": "https://www.doubao.com/work",
                  "toIndex": 34
                }
              ]
            },
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8fitr",
            "text": "访问官网直达：https://www.doubao.com/work；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "85v7f",
            "text": "下载对应系统的独立安装包（支持 Windows 与 macOS，安装体积约 1GB）；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9vms4",
            "text": "安装完成后系统右侧会自动集成桌面悬浮球，支持快捷键随时唤起。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "a0u5o",
            "text": "步骤 2：登录与最小化权限授权（重要避坑）",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 11,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "ffhbt",
            "text": "推荐登录方式：优先使用飞书账号登录，这样它才能真正发挥“读懂工作痕迹”的威力；普通个人用户亦可使用手机号登录；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              },
              {
                "length": 33,
                "offset": 25,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "4gmiq",
            "text": "最小权限原则：首次使用会弹出文件夹与应用授权弹窗。建议只授权特定工作文件夹（如 D:\\今日素材 或 桌面/工作任务），严禁将包含个人身份证件、财务密码、私密合同的系统根目录全部直接授权。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4fc4q",
            "text": "步骤 3：熟悉三栏界面与 2 大运行模式",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
