              {
                "length": 3,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "cefu",
            "text": "右侧栏：技能商店（Skill）、外部连接器与工作伙伴小队配置入口。",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 8,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "2tnej",
            "text": "两大运行模式选择：",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 8,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "ed2nl",
            "text": "本地虚拟桌面模式：在电脑后台开辟沙盒静默执行，不抢占前台鼠标，边办公边让 AI 跑任务；",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 7,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "2pagq",
            "text": "云电脑托管模式：适合耗时极长或定时批量任务（如全网爬取 300 篇竞品图文），电脑关机任务依然在云端持续推进。\n",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 10,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
