          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9vb4n",
            "text": "03 / 5 大高频实战场景与可直接抄的 Prompt 模板",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cdqur",
            "text": "实操 1：调用飞书上下文自动撰写深度周报/月报",
